---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
const bookingKey = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_BOOKING_KEY ?? '';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Book Julian Perez — DJ & Producer | Booking Inquiries"
  description="Book Julian Perez for your event. Techno, House and Minimal DJ based in Spain, resident at Underground Ibiza. Performed in 50+ countries and 150 cities worldwide."
>
  <Header />
  <main style="min-height:100vh; background:#0E0E0E; padding: 160px 52px 120px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">

    <div class="section-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Booking</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.1;">Julian Perez</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 64px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;">
      DJ &amp; Producer · House · Techno · Minimal · Ibiza Underground Resident
    </p>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      {[
        ["50+", "Countries"],
        ["150+", "Cities"],
        ["30+", "Years active"],
      ].map(([num, label]) => (
        <div style="background: #141414; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff;">{num}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; margin-top: 6px;">{label}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #aaa; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <p>Julian Perez developed his connection to electronic music in the early 1990s, shaped by the House and Techno scenes emerging from the US, the UK, and Northwestern Europe. Genres such as techno, EBM, and New Beat played a key role in defining his sound, which has evolved with patience, discernment, and a deep respect for the culture.</p>
        <p>In 2010, he released his first record. Two years later, he founded Fathers &amp; Sons Productions (2012), a vinyl-only label that hosted showcases in more than twelve countries within its first year. His music has also appeared on Cocoon Recordings, Raum..Musik, and Subwax Bcn.</p>
        <p>He founded Girada Unlimited, which gained strong underground support. Its tenth release was his second album, Break-Even (2021). His debut album Solemnity (2016) was released as a double vinyl on Fathers &amp; Sons Productions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #aaa; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <p>Julian has performed in more than 50 countries and over 150 cities. Festivals include Amsterdam Dance Event, Outline Festival, Sunwaves, Epizode, The BPM Festival, Sónar off week, Kazantip, and Winter Music Conference.</p>
        <p>Club appearances span Rex Club (Paris), Fabric (London), Womb (Tokyo), and Robert Johnson (Frankfurt). In Ibiza, he holds a regular summer residency at Underground and has appeared at ENTER. at Space and Cocoon Ibiza.</p>
        <p>Nominated Best Artist at the Vicious Music Awards (2012, 2013) and Best Newcomer at the DJ Awards (2016). Author of INTERFASE: The Infinite Set (2026).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #111; padding: 48px; max-width: 600px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 32px; color: #fff;">Booking Inquiry</h2>
      <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST"
            style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value={bookingKey} />
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Booking Inquiry — julianperez.com/booking" />
        <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://julianperez.com/booking?sent=true" />

        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #666;">Name *</label>
          <input type="text" name="name" required style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #222; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; box-sizing: border-box;" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #666;">Email *</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #222; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; box-sizing: border-box;" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #666;">Event / Venue</label>
          <input type="text" name="event" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #222; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; box-sizing: border-box;" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #666;">Date</label>
          <input type="text" name="date" placeholder="DD/MM/YYYY" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #222; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; box-sizing: border-box;" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #666;">Message</label>
          <textarea name="message" rows="4" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #222; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; box-sizing: border-box; resize: vertical;"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit"
                style="padding: 14px 32px; background: #fff; color: #000; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; border: none; cursor: pointer; align-self: flex-start;">
          Send Inquiry
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
